<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-μικτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unmixed with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἔξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					483b1
				</span></i>
			; <i>pure from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυπαρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i>Eup. Praef.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eustr.
				<u>in EN</u>
				294.12
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.8.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				40.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>avoiding contact,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				39
			</span></i>; <i>not mixing</i> with others, <i>unsocial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος ἀ. ὁμιλίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.438c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαιτα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τό ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπιμιξία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.1.2
			</span></i>: of a country, <i>unfrequented, unvisited,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενικαῖς δυνάμεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.604b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ἀ. πάθεσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				989c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιῆσαί τι ἀ. ἑαυτῷ</span>
			to make it <i>alien from</i> oneself, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.121S.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
